# win32u: Introduce a keyboard layout cache
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/12675 state=closed
# This is my take on !11909. All the changes were originally fixing a bug visible in winex11 or winemac or making things easier for the following patches. I've been iterating these patches quite a few times though, so the exact reason for some of the changes might not be super apparent by now. Feel free to ask for clarification.

The exception to that is the change of `keyboard_layouts` from a list to an rbtree, which is something I meant to do for a while (except it was for the winex11 layout list - which is entirely gone now, nicely enough) and that should be pretty reasonable, I think.
